# ⚙️ Engine Pipeline

```text
DataFetcher
      │
      ▼
Indicators
      │
      ▼
Signals
      │
      ▼
Portfolio
      │
      ▼
Excel Reports
```

---

# 🔬 Research Pipeline

```text
Sampling
      │
      ▼
run_backtest()
      │
      ▼
Statistics
      │
      ▼
Correlation
      │
      ▼
Importance
      │
      ▼
Excel / HTML / JSON
```

